  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily is in class. Teacher Kim has a poster. It has a big ship. The ship is blue and white. Teacher Kim says, \"Look at it.\" \"Stand, please.\" The children stand.",
      "\"Ask a question.\" \"Is it a bus?\" asks Leo. It is a good question. \"No!\" Teacher Kim smiles. \"Answer, please.\" \"It is a ship!\" says Lily.",
      "\"Thumbs up!\" Leo shows a thumbs up. Lily smiles. She likes the ship. \"Sit, please.\" The children sit. An alphabet is next to the poster. \"Look!\""
    ],
    "summary": "Teacher Kim shows a poster of a ship. The children stand, ask a question, give an answer, and sit.",
